 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` creates an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902) that changes one
+JSON document into another. It emits operations for only the changed paths where possible and does not modify either
+input.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+createPatch(
+  { profile: { name: "Ada", theme: "light" } },
+  { profile: { name: "Ada", theme: "dark" } },
+); // [{ op: "replace", path: "/profile/theme", value: "dark" }]
+```
+
 ## JSON Merge Patch
 
 `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
